 ["fixedbugs/issue7690.go" "runtime.Stack's frames (goi's nodes, not gc's), searched by regexp"]
 ["fixedbugs/issue11656.go" "runtime.Callers and runtime.FuncForPC of gc's program counters (syscall.Mprotect over the code)"]
 ["fixedbugs/issue8606b.go" "== of interfaces holding structs compares their fields by goi's and reflect's equality, not gc's generated order (string lengths first): a string pointing into protected memory faults"]
 ["fixedbugs/issue4618.go" "testing.AllocsPerRun counts the interpreter's allocations, not gc's (escape analysis)"]
