 ["fixedbugs/issue4468.go" "errorcheck: go/parser rejects it, gc's syntax reports some of its errors: types2's (must be function call) on syntax's tree, which repr/go does not read"]
 ["slice3err.go" "errorcheck: go/parser rejects it, gc's syntax reports some of its errors: types2's (3-index slice of string) on syntax's tree, which repr/go does not read"]
